OL,5,G2200 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,6,     FIn London an estate agent disputes
OL,7,     Fa #6k debt owed to a client as
OL,8,     Ftempers flare and police are
OL,9,     Fcalled. In Sussex, an enforcement
OL,10,     Fagent pursues debts linked to a
OL,11,     Fclosed ice-cream shop.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,14,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,15,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,16,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic,
OL,17,     Fbut that can hugely affect the
OL,18,     Fsufferers.
